"text":"それでは、おやすみなさい♭.°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-34943":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Galileo Galileiさんのラストライブ、\n行ってきたーーー！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行けてよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりに綺麗すぎる時間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行けるかどうかわからなかったけど、\n一か八かで 数ヶ月前からチケット\n取っておいてホントよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたまお仕事が休みになって、\n行くことができたよ＼(◎o◎)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神さま有難う(泣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から1人で物販並んで、\n最後のグッズも手に入れてきた！\n先着順のサイン入り色紙も\nゲットしたぜ(๑`･ᴗ･´๑)！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宝物にする。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応 ２枚チケット取ったけど、\n一緒に観る人いなかったから\nもう１枚は万理華にあげた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは、現在から昔に\n遡っていくような感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一曲一曲思い入れがあったけど\nオリジナルバージョンの管制塔と、\nアンコールのハローグッバイは\nずるい。涙なしには見れなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車輪の軸、いつもより最後長くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この音が止まったら\nGalileo Galileiが終わるんだ、\nってわかった瞬間、胸が苦しくなった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８年前の閃光ライオット。\nSCHOOL OF LOCK!というラジオ番組が\n大好きで、興味本位でリスナー仲間と\nたまたま観に行ったファイナルステージ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時見た彼らに胸を打たれて\n閃光のコンピCDを購入し、\n「雨のちガリレオ」を購入し、\nすっかり魅力にはまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じくらいの年齢だから\n共感できる歌詞が多くて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"繊細な言葉選びというか、\nとても綺麗な日本語で表現する\nセンスが秀逸で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、文学的っていうのかな、\nん、ちょっとわからないんだけど（笑）\nそんな感じの深みのある歌詞が\n好きだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗事を歌ってる訳でも、\n明るい言葉で飾ってる訳でもないのに、\nふんわり元気をもらえる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそんな力があった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぎ兄さんの透明感のある\n真っ直ぐな歌声も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心地いいサウンドも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても大好きでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PVの聖地巡礼をしたこともあったし、\nフェスとかライブとか、ほんと楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学から今まで、共に過ごした音楽。\n沢山の素敵な時間を有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Galileo Galileiは、私の青春そのものでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああーすきだーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会えて本当に本当によかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかまた彼らの音楽が聴けますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/12/3855974/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24727":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/08/19/4354051/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ガチ寝撮られてました〜(°_°)\n熟睡中にまいまいちゃんに求婚されたので結婚してこようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいみんのみんな、ごめんよ(((ρT-T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すいません、冗談でございます。\nみんなの聖母だからね！\n大丈夫、安心して。\nちゃんとわかってるから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかお久しぶりです。\nもう8月も半ばですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん先日の乃木坂工事中\nみてくれました⁈\nついに私のフィーチャー回が(*ﾉωﾉ)ｷｬｯ\n正直に言うと、相談する方はもっと別の方にすれば良かっ......(´-ω-`)\nたなんて思っておりません！！！笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野呂さん、菊地さんには沢山助けて頂いて、随分気を遣わせてしまっただろうなと少し反省もしつつ。。。\nバラエティーに関しては沢山勉強させて頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野呂さん、菊地さん\n本当ありがとうございました！\nまた機会があった時には、よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は全国ツアーの真っ最中\n仙台、名古屋、広島の3ヶ所\n計8公演が終了しました〜〜\n折り返し地点！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は福岡、来週に大阪\nそして、30、31日東京が待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアー終わったら夏が終わる〜(°_°)\n私の大好きな夏が......(((ρT-T)ρｵﾖﾖ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今年もいい夏だったと言える様に\n残りのLIVE頑張りますね☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/08/19/4354051/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/08/19/4354051/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もベマーズ撮影です！\n只今最終話撮影中！もうすぐです！\nラストスパート頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/08/19/4354051/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11477":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"んっちゃぁぁおりゃぁぁ！とっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アミッキー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、名古屋個別あくちゅかい❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶりんらぶりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみと短い時間づつだがデート気分味わおうne～)^o^("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の全握の時は手羽先食べ損ねたからなぁ...今回こそは...。。くっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風来坊？？いただきたいしだいだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、ずーさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーさんはうまいこと手羽先食べれるのかな...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手羽先って正しい食べ方みたいなのあるんでしょ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の人教えてぇやぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまいことトゥルンッ♪っていくのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ねぇ、ちーちゃんが愛未のことを悟りを開いてるような目で見てくるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三日月風味って感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかその目で見られるとねぇ、なんか嘘とか全部見抜かれてる感じがするの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな目か気になる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、気になる方は明日あみが再現...といいたいとこだけどやっぱちーちゃんにやってもらってください。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしには...出来ない...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく明日は楽しもうね  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7041":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり伝えたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思ったので書かせて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、16位に入ることが出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん みんな知ってるよね？？..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごくすっごく嬉しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれた瞬間頭真っ白になっちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に大切にトランプ役を演じさせてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、本当に、本当に嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみに投票してくださった皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら会場には来ることが出来なかった皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援コメント下さった皆様、応援テレパシー送ってくださった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の底からありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのプリンシパル観せたかったから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たった1票の差で2幕に出れるか出れないかが決まったりする時もある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にシビアです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直言うと、毎回の公演が怖いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逃げ出したくもなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台中に涙が出そうになる時もあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、私は絶対に逃げません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、あみにはこんなに暖かくて優しいファンの皆様がいるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは最後の最後まで、絶対に絶対に16人の中に入る事を諦めません。諦めたくもありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが舞台上で流すのは、嬉し涙だけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の悔しい気持ちを忘れず、明日からの公演も全力で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの個性を存分に発揮したいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ、頑張るから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に頑張るから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってあみあみ族みんなの笑顔が見たいもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*｀へ´*) にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未、まだまだ前進します。"}],"source":"archive"}}